  'agra-street-food-tour-with-spice-market-tuk-tuk': {
    averageRating: 4.5,
    totalReviews: 24,
    guideRating: 4.56,
    valueRating: 4.54,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Vuk", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-16", text: "If you are looking for a great guide and a safe places to eat - look no further, this is your tour and Amir is your guide! We wanted to try street food in Agra and he took us to the right place - a street next to bazaar ( I cant remember the name) where we were able to try different sweet and savoury delights. My personal favourites were the vege kebab and ice cream from buffalo milk. Amir knew the sellers (and sellers obviously knew him), so we did not wait long to try the food. Everything was really delicious. My only recommendation is to skip the dinner / go super hungry, so you can enjoy it fully and try more things. : )", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-street-food-tour-with-spice-market-tuk-tuk/2151616/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-street-food-tour-with-spice-market-tuk-tuk/2151617/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Desiree", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-13", text: "Delicious food, awesome guide, great time. The communication for pick up was great and right on time. As we traveled, I was told information of the city, Agra Fort and Taj Mahal. And once at the food market I was told about all the different types of food and how they were made. I definitely suggest this tour!" },
      { author: "Elizabeth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-26", text: "From the start of this tour, they were very accommodating. My flight was delayed which meant I had to push back my tour time and they were happy to do so. Amir my guide was very knowledge on the entire tour. He also cared a lot about my safety as we walked the streets. Very friendly, calm, welcoming and funny. At the end of the tour I asked him for a dinner recommendation and he rerouting our Tuk Tuk to a restaurant called the Salt Bar. Amazing experience! 10/10 and would be recommending him to friends also." },
      { author: "Jack", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-19", text: "Guide was great friendly service and very knowledgeable, food was incredible love Indian cuisine!" },
      { author: "Helen Jane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-25", text: "Our guide, Shubham, was utterly brilliant from start to finish. There was a slight confusion at the start as to which tour we’d booked (the Street Food Tour with Spice Market) versus a walking tour of the Old Town, but in the end he as able to combine the best of both and we were able to try some street foods (pani puri, chole bhatura, samosa with sauces, milk cake, lassi and much more) whilst walking through the Old Market and to Jama Masjid. We also visited a marble workshop (we we apprehensive about this, but it was so interesting and there was no hard-sell). Our guide was entertaining and informative and we had a brilliant afternoon. We traveled by tuk tuk and also tried our Agra’s new metro which was very clean and efficient to Londoners like us!" },
      { author: "Hannah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-22", text: "We were a family of 6, we loved trying the street food with our guide Amir and we said we didn’t want to go shopping so didn’t get taken to any shops. Well worth the trip" },
      { author: "Karen Elizabeth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-23", text: "I loved the food tour! I would definitely recommend it! Amir was very kind and explained all, and he made sure about the places where I should try it!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-street-food-tour-with-spice-market-tuk-tuk/1138595/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-street-food-tour-with-spice-market-tuk-tuk/1138596/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "edward", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-21", text: "Great tour with Amir who made me feel safe and secure and thoughtfully showed me lots of fabulous Indian food!" },
      { author: "Fan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-13", text: "We were able to have a taste of Agar with the help on Amir. Food was amazingly good and Amir is really helpful :)) Note that the tour includes marble and art shop after the food tour. The embroidery was amazing", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-street-food-tour-with-spice-market-tuk-tuk/1067910/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-street-food-tour-with-spice-market-tuk-tuk/1067911/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-street-food-tour-with-spice-market-tuk-tuk/1067912/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Mar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-28", text: "Incredible tour! We tasted the best flavors of Agra’s street food. Amir an amazing and very funny person. If you come to Agra, this tour is a must!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-street-food-tour-with-spice-market-tuk-tuk/958547/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/agra-street-food-tour-with-spice-market-tuk-tuk/958549/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Mirta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-31", text: "The experience was really nice! We learned a lot about Indian food and Indian culture. Amir was an amazing guide, we highly recommend this activity when in Agra." },
      { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-28", text: "I would recommend this tour to anyone visiting Agra. The sights,sounds and smells were amazing. Our guide provided a very insightful description of Old Agra that brought us so close to the local people and shops. This was exactly what we were looking for. Sorry I forgot to mention the street food, it was a treat to taste the flavours and dishes of this area. Try this trip you will not be disappointed ." },
    ],
  },
