  'delhi-private-full-or-half-day-old-and-new': {
    averageRating: 4.87,
    totalReviews: 18,
    guideRating: 4.62,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "wenza", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-13", text: "I had an amazing tour of Delhi! The itinerary was perfectly planned, covering all the main attractions in just one day. My guide, Aman, took great care of me and ensured I was comfortable throughout. He shared fascinating insights about the historic sites, and I learned so much about Delhi’s rich culture and history. He also recommended some delicious street food, which I really enjoyed. Overall, I’m very happy with this tour and would highly recommend it!" },
      { author: "Marina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-07", text: "Harsh. Patel was my guide, I enjoyed my tour thoroughly and had a very pleasant and stress-free experience. Thanks a lot! 🙏🏻" },
      { author: "YUZA", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-25", text: "This Delhi tour was wonderful! saw famous spots and learned so much about the city’s history. The guide was patient, knowledgeable, and made the tour fun. I had a memorable time and would definitely suggest this tour to others." },
      { author: "Joshua", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-19", text: "Quick 3-4 hour trip to old Delhi. Right at the height of Diwali! So many people, so much to take in! Mohammad was our tour guide very nice. Let us relax and dictate. Aman was the driver, very safe and easy." },
      { author: "Craig", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-19", text: "Absolutely phenomenal day with Kavya. Our driver was Azhar and was really good at navigating and being where we were at. On time and phenomenal driver! Kavya was extremely knowledgeable and showed us the sides of India we would not have seen without doing this tour. 100% recommend using Kavya as your guide and using his services. His expert photography skills make taking photos a breeze and different angles than one would normally do. Very enjoyable time and will definitely come back and go on several more tours with him. Was respectful to my family and I really couldn’t ask for a better experience. Really topped off our visit to India and we can’t wait to come back now.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-full-or-half-day-old-and-new/4293454/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-full-or-half-day-old-and-new/4293455/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/delhi-private-full-or-half-day-old-and-new/4293456/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Darren", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-16", text: "I had an excellent day touring Old and New Delhi with Vikram and Mohd. Azhar. They were punctual, friendly, and made the whole experience enjoyable and stress-free. We explored some incredible places and learned a lot along the way. I highly recommend this tour to anyone wanting to see the real Delhi!" },
      { author: "Denzil", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-04", text: "The tour around Delhi and New Delhi were good, Mr. Abhishek was my tour guide and he was very accomodating. I arrived late at the pick up in my hotel because of some changes in my sched, but he was willing to wait and welcomed me with a smile. Our driver was also good and the best part of it, the car smells great, AC was good, so you will be very comfortable through out the tour. I will definitely recommend this people. Thank you Mr. Abhishek for a great experience, it somehow removed the vibes of Delhi’s traffic." },
      { author: "Richard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-01", text: "Very friendly and knowledgeable felt very comfortable with him thank you so much" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-13", text: "I had a wonderful day exploring Delhi with my guide, Mohammad Kadir. He was very knowledgeable and shared many interesting facts about each place we visited. He was friendly, patient, and made me feel safe and comfortable as a solo traveler. Everything was well organized, and I truly enjoyed the experience. I highly recommend him to anyone visiting Delhi!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-12", text: "Qadir was an outstanding tour guide — professional, knowledgeable, and attentive to every detail. Both the car and tuk-tuk drivers were courteous and reliable. I highly recommend this tour and especially commend Qadir for making the experience exceptional." },
      { author: "Johanna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-09", text: "Gracias a nuestro guia Viru y a nuestro conductor Wasim pudimos llevarnos buenos recuerdos y impresiones de esa ciudad tan vibante, impulsiva y hermosa. Gracias por todo." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-06", text: "Tour personalizado , nos llevaron a conocer algunos lugares agradables" },
    ],
  },
