  'from-delhi-private-overnight-jaipur-guided-tour': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 3,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Kyle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-18", text: "Mohammed was an excellent guide and took us through all the highlights efficiently and he was extremely knowledgeable. I would highly recommend booking this tour with him.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-overnight-jaipur-guided-tour/6278694/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Christine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-02", text: "We had a nice experience exploring the beautiful city of Jaipur, thanks to our guide, Mohamed. From start to finish, he was professional, knowledgeable, and passionate about sharing the rich history and culture of Rajasthan. Mohamed took us to some of the must-see attractions in Jaipur, including the majestic Amber Fort, the Hawa Mahal (Palace of Winds), and Thikana Mandir Sri Govinddevji where we took nice pictures of the sun setting. On day two. we did not see the Jantar Mantar observatory but instead went to the elephant temple, followed by the stunning City Palace and ended the tour at the monkey palace. He was happy to answer all of our questions and tailored the tour to suit our needs. Overall, a smooth and informative tour — a good choice if you’re looking to see the main highlights of Jaipur in a short amount of time.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-overnight-jaipur-guided-tour/4055844/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Marta Salva", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-10", text: "All went very well, tour exceed my expectations in all aspects. Car very comfortable, spacious, new. Safe driver, Tanveer, very responsible and kind. He was a good companion for this trip, attentive on the road, willing to keep conversation and practise his English. The tour itself and visits to monuments went a bit flexible, we swap the order from what was in the plan, but overall everything was covered. Resulted in getting two different guides, Muhammed on day1 where we covered most of historical sites, experienced guide, helping with shopping tips as well, and Ferman on day2, also fluent in Spanish. Both were fluent in English, well spoken on the history and curiosities of Jaipur and Indian culture in general; young motivated guides very attentive and willing to make you feel happy with the day in every possible way. I felt like a guest being toured around with locals and not just a client being taken from place to place as routine. I'd definitely recommend this group to anyone." },
    ],
  },
