  'from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-and-agra-day-tour': {
    averageRating: 4.92,
    totalReviews: 3096,
    guideRating: 4.95,
    valueRating: 4.86,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Desland", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-27", text: "Our tour guide Asad was amazing! He was very knowledgeable about the history of Taj Mahal and presented it in a very engaging way. I thoroughly enjoyed the tour and would highly recommend Asad." },
      { author: "Oluwatobi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-27", text: "Absolutely loved this. Asim was my guide and I loved how knowledgeable and enthusiastic he was about everything including my multiple questions, and helping us navigate the monuments. Our driver Sunil was equally good, especially considering the super early morning pickup (3am). Everything was on time, seamless and memorable. I totally recommend", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-and-agra-day-tour/8940288/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-and-agra-day-tour/8940289/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-26", text: "Excellent experience from start to finish. Our guide was professional, knowledgeable, and very personable. He shared interesting history about the Taj Mahal, answered all of our questions, and made the visit enjoyable and stress-free. I would definitely recommend this tour and our guide to others visiting Agra." },
      { author: "Lewis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-26", text: "Sameer was a great help, taking me round the Taj and the Fort. Gave me plenty of information and was very kind and genuine. Pankaj was also a great driver and even helped get to and from my hotel (it was not easy to find)" },
      { author: "Jeremy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-24", text: "Rafiq was sensational. Very clearly knowledgeable about the Taj and English was great making communication seemless. Was so great showing my son this Taj - what a magnificent structure and our tour made the experience even more special." },
      { author: "Nicole", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-24", text: "Iqbal and Rahul were great! Iqbal was very insightful and gave excellent information during my tour. Rahul was an outstanding driver. He was safe and followed all the rules. Thank you both for a great morning!" },
      { author: "Rene", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-23", text: "The Taj Mahal tour was flawlessly organized from start to finish. Our guide, Faiz and our driver wer super punctual, exceptionally friendly, and deeply knowledgeable about the monument's rich history and architecture. Navigating the ticket lines and security checks was completely stress-free thanks to him. On top of that, he knew all the best photo spots to capture amazing shots without crowds in the background and his skills Tomaten photographs Left us a very nice Memory of this day. If you're visiting Agra, booking this tour is an absolute must and make sure you get Faiz as a tour guide!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-and-agra-day-tour/8874860/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Nandhu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-22", text: "wonderful knowledgable trip witj Muaaz !!Highly reccomandable🙃🤝", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-private-taj-mahal-and-agra-day-tour/8860367/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Lissette", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-22", text: "I love my experience and the tour. It was a complete one and we were able to see all the highlights. Thanks to our driver Sonu he was awesome and to our tour guide Iqbal to show us and explain everything about the momuments, history, etc. Namaste!" },
      { author: "Dan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-22", text: "Big thanks to our driver, Atul, and our tour guide, Faiz. Atul collected us promptly at 2:30am, and drove us safely from Delhi to Agra, where we met our tour guide. We mostly tried to sleep in the car and I’d recommend taking an eye mask. Faiz was a great guide, very knowledgeable and willing to take photos of us along the way. He was patient and provided the right level of detail about the Taj Mahal. This trip exceeded my expectations and if you can accept the long drive from Delhi, it is a must do activity." },
      { author: "Maximilian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-21", text: "A great experience from start to finish. Sunil, our driver, picked us up at 6am. He was even 20min early and we went straight from Delhi to Agra. The whole drive felt very safe and comfortable. Upon arrival, Azzu joined and showed us through the Taj Mahal and the Fort. He answered all our questions and informed us about the history of the sights. 10/10" },
      { author: "Gregory", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-21", text: "Rafrq was an amazing guide with a lot of knowledge. He answered all of our questions about the Taj Mahal. Will definitely recommend to all my friends." },
    ],
  },
