  'from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-by-luxury-superfast': {
    averageRating: 4.98,
    totalReviews: 52,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.98,
    reviews: [
      { author: "susan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "Our tour to taj mahal was very good. Specially, the guide was very friendly and food was good too. our transportation upto the destination was also nice. thanks to manish, Ali ." },
      { author: "Pattara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-26", text: "Farman was just great throughout the tour. Mr Aazim was our Driver. I will definitely recommend their service. And the train journey was very smooth like.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-by-luxury-superfast/8369122/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Johannes", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "Mr Shanu was fantastic. He booked the train tickets fkr us in advance. Also they came to pick us up at the station with very nice clean car. The Guide was more than amazing he also took the pictures of us.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-by-luxury-superfast/8332840/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Martin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-23", text: "Mr Raj did an awesome job in my tour with Gatimaan & he was very polite. I will come to India again with my friends and I will book again." },
      { author: "Sophia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-23", text: "Mr Adeeb was our Guide. He was beyond awesome. Very charming and knowledgeable. I will book again with him. Driver was best . And train journey was very smooth. It is the best tour for Gatimaan Taj Mahal visit no doubt." },
      { author: "Amelia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-23", text: "Farman was the best Guide I ever found in india. Train Journey was super fantastic and relaxing. I will book again with Raj Travels." },
      { author: "Martina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-22", text: "Such a fantastic and magical day. Our guide, Abdul, was so knowledgeable and gave us a great understanding of the history and an appreciation for the artistry and effort that makes this a true Wonder. He managed the pacing perfectly, giving us time to explore more when we wanted, and answered every questions patiently and knowledgeably. At the end of the day we had a little extra time and he brought us to a place to see and learn about the craftsmanship that went into the Taj Maha, which gave us a greater understanding and appreciation. Cannot recommend this tour, and especially Abdul, enough.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-by-luxury-superfast/7272247/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Lauren", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-18", text: "It was a wonderful experience right from picking us from the hotel to railway station. Our tickets were already booked and were given to us by the driver. The breakfast on the train was nice. We met our excellent tour guide Imran at the railway station. He was a pro Mughal history. He took some amazing pictures of us. The luch at bon barbeque was delicious. We had a fantastic day trip to Agra. Thank you to the team." },
      { author: "Marylise", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-18", text: "I recently booked the Same-Day Gatimaan Express Tour from Delhi to Agra, and the entire experience was nothing short of excellent. From start to finish, everything was handled professionally and efficiently, making it a perfect day trip for anyone short on time but eager to explore the beauty of Agra." },
      { author: "Jamie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-11", text: "Our guide was very prompt in picking us up at the time we requested. Throughout the tour he remained extremely professional and knowledgeable about all aspects of our itinerary. We had a great time and would book again." },
      { author: "Shozo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-09", text: "It was a fantastic and amazing tour of me. Though there was a traffic jam and I had to ruin my time to wait for picking me up, it was a good tour to know how wonderful Taj Mahal and Afrabfort are. My tour guide and driver, Akhtar and Shaan, tried to do their best to satisfy me. His explanation made it possible for me to understand the detailed the history of Taj Mahal and details to enjoy Taj Mahal. It was like a private tour instead of a group tour. I strongly recommend this tour.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-by-luxury-superfast/5432268/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Veselina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-22", text: "The tour was great. Our guide Vijay Chauhan was very knowledgeable and he gave us a lot of information about the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort. He also made us very good pictures. The driver also was on time in the morning. We went to see Taj Mahal on sunrise and it was beautiful. I recommend this tour if you want to spend a nice day sightseeing Agra.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-by-luxury-superfast/2006779/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-agra-tour-by-luxury-superfast/2006780/1600.webp"] },
    ],
  },
