  'from-delhi-taj-mahal-and-agra-day-tour-by': {
    averageRating: 4.95,
    totalReviews: 426,
    guideRating: 4.94,
    valueRating: 4.9,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Jevgenijs", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-27", text: "I had a very pleasant experience with my guide in Agra. He is a friendly and knowledgeable young man who speaks very good English and knows a lot about the Taj Mahal and its history. He was helpful with advice throughout the tour and was also simply a nice person to talk to. I really enjoyed the time and would definitely recommend him to other visitors.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-and-agra-day-tour-by/8940082/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Karen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-22", text: "This tour was amazing. Shan was the most incredible guide - tremendous local knowledge, very personable and excellent company for me as a solo traveller. He was also very considerate and ensured I was comfortable at all times. It was also fun to chat to Shan about his life in India and mine back in the UK. I fully recommend this tour particularly with Shan as your guide." },
      { author: "Joseph", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-19", text: "Great tour, highly recommend. My guide, Javed Khan, was highly knowledgable and made it a really good day." },
      { author: "Ivan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "On September 12 we had a tour with Ali who was very friendly and helpful. We visited Taj Mahal, Red Fort and some other points of interest. The lunch served in hotel was delicious. Transfer from hotel to Hazrat Nizamuddin railway station and vice versa was also ok." },
      { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Our guide, Faizan was extremely friendly, down to earth and gave great dialogue during the tour. They brought us to a nice restaurant and always made us feel safe and secure. Would recommend!!" },
      { author: "Connor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "Honestly such an inclusive tour right from the start. Being picked up from the hotel, taken straight to the train and shown exactly where to sit. Then collected from the platform in Agra to be taken around by your tour guide and dedicated driver. It made the process of seeing everything so smooth! My tour guide was Nabeel and I was blown away with his knowledge of the Taj Mahal, Red Fort, Baby Taj and surrounding areas. He was very interactive and I’ve had a fantastic time learning from him during my tour. It’s made things so much easier. I’d also like to mention my driver Salman, who successfully navigated the crazy streets and helped me get between all the stops as easily as possible. I honestly don’t think I could’ve managed to see these sights any other way, so I am really thankful for who I got on this tour, and for the company for making such an easy tour." },
      { author: "Gabe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "Faizan was the best guide - fez - I have been on a lot of tours but he knew all the intricate details of my questions and is an excellent storyteller and went into great details and made everything very easy experience", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-and-agra-day-tour-by/8640512/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-and-agra-day-tour-by/8640514/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-and-agra-day-tour-by/8640515/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "Although it was my second trip to Agra, my guide Faizan taught me much more than I had been shown the first trip. Absolutey recommended." },
      { author: "Piotr", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "Absolutely amazing experience! Our guide Nabeel was fantastic - knowledgeable, engaging, and made the whole tour feel special. Nabeel truly knows how to make a tour memorable. We definitely recommend this and hope to see more guides like Nabeel in the future. Our driver was also very nice and drove safely, which we really appreciated. Will be booking again!" },
      { author: "Gerardo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "Sakil picked me up at the hotel and drop me at the train station. He accompanied me to the train and seat. The tour guide, Raj, was waiting for me at train station in Agra, right at the train door. Raj, with 30+years of experience in tours, was very helpful and explained me everything in Taj Mahal, Agra Fort, etc. he also took me to stores to buy rugs, jewelry or ceramic Taxi driver in Agra was also very efficient At return, Sakil was waiting for me at the train door and took me back to the hotel." },
      { author: "Małgorzata", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "A wonderful trip. Very well prepared. Our guide was Safi. He was great at explaining the sights. A great guide. I highly recommend him." },
      { author: "Richard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "It was a great an unforgettable one day trip. The guide was very professional and friendly. Highly recommend." },
    ],
  },
