  'from-delhi-taj-mahal-sunrise-and-agra-fort-private': {
    averageRating: 4.97,
    totalReviews: 89,
    guideRating: 4.97,
    valueRating: 4.93,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Rashmi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-22", text: "Had a beautiful day exploring the Taj Mahal and the Agra Fort. Our driver Ram Sharma was extremely welcoming. He allowed us to play the music we liked, shared a lot of information on the way and even invited us for an Indian chai. Our guide Amit was also very friendly and very eager to satisfy all our needs. He took really good care of us and provided us with so many informations. It really was a fantastic day." },
      { author: "richa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-05", text: "My experience with this tour was amazing! My tour guide was Shubham and the driver Madan, and both made me feel very engaged and it was a very enjoyable experience. I learnt a lot about India, its history and culture because of the clear explanations of Shubham. Also he offered many times to take pictures of me and showed me how to pose, he's a true expert! The food was good as well with many options to try and later on I could have very unique marble souvenirs. All I can say is positive, I recommend this tour :)", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-sunrise-and-agra-fort-private/7961831/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-sunrise-and-agra-fort-private/7961832/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-sunrise-and-agra-fort-private/7961833/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Ana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "We had an amazing Taj Mahal Sunrise Tour booked through Radhika Holiday. Everything was perfectly organized from start to finish. A special thanks to our tour guide, Mohammad Sir, who was extremely knowledgeable, friendly, and professional. He explained the fascinating history of the Taj Mahal in a very engaging way and made sure we enjoyed every moment of the tour. He also knew the best photo spots and helped us avoid the crowds, making the sunrise experience truly unforgettable. The entire tour was smooth, well-managed, and worth every penny. We highly recommend Radhika Holiday and Mohammad Sir to anyone visiting Agra for a memorable Taj Mahal experience. Thank you for making our trip so special! 🌅🏛️" },
      { author: "Merry", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-30", text: "Amit was our guide .He know so much information and was a wealth of knowledge. nit only did we learn so much about the places but we had a guide who knows to talk the best pitchers of us and get the best poses. He also had our backs when people approaches us and guided us well. Hands down wonderful experience. would recommend him and this experience to anyone wanting to see the Taj Mahal." },
      { author: "Enya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-18", text: "Ravi & Manish took me to three impressive sites in Agra: the Taj Mahal, baby Taj and Agra Fort. each location I learnt a lot about the history and the architecture, as well as the history of Agra. The tour was very engaging and they allowed me as much time as I needed at each site, including photo stops! fantastic tour, highly recommend Ravi & Manish!" },
      { author: "Nicole", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-11", text: "I had a wonderful experience in Jaipur thanks to my tour guide Bhanwar, and my driver Yusuf. From the very beginning, they were extremely professional and attentive. They took me to all tourist main points, always handling my luggage with care and making sure everything was smooth and stress-free. Both of them were always on time, which I really appreciated, and they were incredibly friendly and pleasant to be around. Bhanwar is very knowledgeable and shared fascinating insights about Jaipur’s history and culture, which made the tour even more enjoyable. Yusuf is an excellent driver — very safe, careful, and reliable. The car was always clean and comfortable, which made traveling around the city a pleasure, and always supplying with mineral water. I felt safe, well taken care of, and genuinely welcomed throughout my trip. I will definitely keep their contact details for my next visit to India and highly recommend them to anyone looking for a trustworthy and enjoyable tour experience." },
      { author: "Sameenah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-06", text: "shubham was an amazing guide that gave us a wonderful tour of the taj mahal we thoroughly enjoyed and he adapted the activities to fit our needs. would highly recommend this excursion and guide" },
      { author: "Agnieszka", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-25", text: "The tour was very nice, the drive was very safe and our guide Nazim was very knowledgeable and told us a lot of about the Taj Mahal and its history.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-sunrise-and-agra-fort-private/5935013/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Rabina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-19", text: "A special thanks to our guide, Ajad, who made the experience even more meaningful. He explained the history of the Taj Mahal with great knowledge and passion, sharing fascinating stories about Emperor Shah Jahan and Mumtaz Mahal. His friendly nature, clear communication, and attention to detail made the tour smooth and enjoyable. I highly recommend visiting the Taj Mahal with Ajad as your guide. It was an amazing and memorable experience!" },
      { author: "Torry", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-18", text: "Totally worth it. Both Guide and Driver were really helpful and friendly." },
      { author: "Adrian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-20", text: "The tour was great, the guide Iqurar was very nice and helpful, offered a lot of infos about the objectives that we visited and more. Also a talented photographer." },
      { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-08", text: "The sunrise tour was an experience and lots of fun. We enjoyed being taken through the Taj, around some local areas and to the Agra Fort. Our guide Sunny was great with sharing his knowledge and was very accommodating.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-sunrise-and-agra-fort-private/1767934/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-sunrise-and-agra-fort-private/1767935/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/from-delhi-taj-mahal-sunrise-and-agra-fort-private/1767936/1600.webp"] },
    ],
  },
