  'from-jaipur-one-day-trip-to-ranthambore-tiger-safa': {
    averageRating: 3.68,
    totalReviews: 55,
    guideRating: 3.55,
    valueRating: 3.41,
    reviews: [
      { author: "MacKenzie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-10", text: "I saw a tiger! For those wondering, the car ride is 4 hours. My driver was Nadine, we left at 10am and returned at 10:30pm. There's a washroom break an hour before arriving at the park and another washroom at the park in case you want to know like myself. Ac car the whole way, I'm used to long car rides so this was worth the drive." },
      { author: "Jilly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-06", text: "Tour Travel and Transportation were excellent in making all the arrangements and contacting us. Our driver Nadeem Khan was a careful and professional driver and very knowledgeable. He even found us some chai to drink while we waiting for the jeep to take us into the safari park. Very very happy to have been in such good hands" },
      { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-16", text: "The whole tour was great. Our driver Nadeem, was very kind. Very knowledgeable and easy to communicate with. We could not have had a better experience! The tiger safari itself was also great! The safari guides were very knowledgeable and we saw a tiger at the very last minute! Our guides made sure we were all able to see it before leaving." },
      { author: "Mindaugas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-17", text: "Nadim was perfect driver. I loved his service and extra places he showed was nice" },
      { author: "Bill", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-12", text: "The activity was great! We were very lucky to see 4 tigers (a mother and cubs). Nadim, our driver from the hotel was lovely and looked after us both ways. The experience overall was really good and I’d recommend it" },
      { author: "Virginia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-10-16", text: "The organization for pick up at the hotel and gate was very easy via WhatsApp. We had the chance to choose the Gate number 3 for entrance, because we heard it might be the best one for seeing tigers. Even it was the Canter (because Gypsy was booked out for weeks) we where lucky to see the tiger. Our driver was also very friendly." },
      { author: "Phoebe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-08-24", text: "Sam was amazing!! Had so much information to share and made sure we had everything we needed! Such a good day out!!" },
      { author: "Anouk", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-08-15", text: "Great tour! We were picked up at our hotel by a very friendly and helpful driver Sam, who brought us to Ranthambore safely. The safari was great too, even though we didn't see the tiger, we saw lots of other animals and enjoyed the beautiful park. Sam drove us safely back to Jaipur and had many tips for the rest of our travels. Would recommend!" },
      { author: "dennis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-08-02", text: "very nice safari to go on, lots of animals in the park, also sam did a great job driving me from jaipur and back" },
      { author: "Cooper", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2024-04-04", text: "The activity was nice and scenic. However, we really did not know what was going on because the guide would not speak to us in English. Also, the other people on the tour with us were not pleasant. Our driver, Manoj, was great and very skilled at driving." },
      { author: "Karol", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2023-11-06", text: "We liked visit in Rathambore very much. We had very good and safe driver - Mohammad Shakir. He was very friendly and funny! We had luck to see tigers, which is not guaranteed! If you really want to increase your chance to see them, it’s better to book more than one visit. One thing we really missed is guide at Rathambore who didn’t speak English, so we didn’t learned a lot about tigers." },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-03-07", text: "horrible communication with tour company. I asked a question and didn't get an answer until 11 months later. If I had the answer sooner I would have rebooked with a different company and had a much better experience. This company also will not let you know your driver's name or license plate so you know who to expect at the hotel pickup. This company also only offers Canters a 16+ person vehicle that is packed with people and very uncomfortable. I would recommend paying an extra 15$ person and getting a different company that offers Jeeps. When an animal is spotted on the Canter if you are on the opposite side you will not be able to see the animal. Pay extra and book with a different company. The only highlight was the driver from the hotel to the park was very nice and punctual." },
    ],
  },
