  'heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur': {
    averageRating: 4.97,
    totalReviews: 195,
    guideRating: 4.96,
    valueRating: 4.94,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Abhijit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "the guide was very knowledgeable and he had a lot of information to share with us. Kumar knew the streets of the pink City very well and took us to a lot of different sights to see. He is able to tailor the tour to your preference, and if you don't have one, he is able to create a fun experience regardless! would recommend!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/8714225/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/8714226/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/heritage-walk-street-food-tasting-in-jaipur/8714227/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Ann", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-19", text: "I went on a food tour and I had a great time. The guide is very nice person, it was really comfortable, like we were friends, we chatted on a different topics and of course tried different local street food. Can definitely recommend" },
      { author: "Martin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-21", text: "Excellent fun. This is our second street food tour whilst in India and our favourite. Food was good, information was excellent and the city is great. Would recommend this to anyone coming to Jaipur.." },
      { author: "Inigo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-08", text: "This was the absolute highlight of our holiday and the best experience we had on our trip to India. It felt like seeing Jaipur with a friend. Vivek was so brilliant, knowledgeable and kind. It really felt like we saw the heart and soul of Jaipur and understood so much more about this beautiful city. The tour was super flexible around what we were interested in and we ended up asking Vivek to spend a whole extra day with us to see the main monuments and go to the extra places and shops we wanted to see - totally worth every penny and more. Vivek even helped arrange travel for our next destination and provided contacts in the next city we were staying in. We felt so lucky and couldn’t recommend this tour enough - thank you Vivek!" },
      { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-26", text: "Incredible experience. We were lucky to have a private tour with Vivek. Great customer service and he even saved us from having to sort out our travel to Agra. You have to do this!!" },
      { author: "Kanchan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-08", text: "We had an amazing tour with Vivek, he showed us some great spots, was great with the kids and such a lovely guide. Thanks a lot we will be back for other tours next tme 🙏🏿" },
      { author: "Jasdeep", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-05", text: "Was great A must do when in Jaipur Vivek was a brilliant guide" },
      { author: "May", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-02", text: "What a fantastic tour from a true local. Vivek is a knowledgeable and kind guide and he explained more about the city's history, architecture and food! He was great at answering all questions. We walked around the local area, taking in beautiful havelis, whilst sampling a whole host of sweet and savoury local foods and of course chai. It was a very good introduction to the cuisine and culture. Highly recommended!" },
      { author: "Rahmat", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-01", text: "It was a good walk and food tour, the guide is very kind and interesting to tell stories and answers all my questions throughout and we are even staying longer to see a festival, totally recommended tour." },
      { author: "Murugesh", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-29", text: "Jaipur Evening Food Tour Review – Guide Vivekananda (Vicky) This evening we had a wonderful food tour in the Pink City, Jaipur, with our guide Vivekananda (Vicky). He was extremely knowledgeable not only about Jaipur city, but also about its culture, history, and of course, its amazing food. We started with delicious samosas, followed by a lovely walk through the side streets where Vicky explained the history of the old houses and the heritage of the Pink City. He then took us to some of the best local savoury shops where we enjoyed kachori, lentil dosa, mirchi bajji, and chai — everything was absolutely delicious and authentic. As we continued walking, Vicky shared fascinating stories about the kings, the city planning, and the UNESCO World Heritage status of Jaipur. It was like walking through history while enjoying the best street food in the city. Overall, it was a gold star evening. I would highly recommend this tour to anyone , but ask for Vicky 🫶🏽" },
      { author: "Katharine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-27", text: "Vivek was a delight. So knowledgeable, interesting and kind. We got to see parts of the city we never would have done without him. He knows everyone and all the places to get the best street food, which was all delicious. Would highly recommend." },
      { author: "Ella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-26", text: "A great tour with delicious food but also a fantastic insight into the bazaars and history of the pink city." },
    ],
  },
