  'jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old': {
    averageRating: 4.95,
    totalReviews: 61,
    guideRating: 4.98,
    valueRating: 4.84,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Amritha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-25", text: "Super adventure! Special mention to Aman who took extra care of my mum while she wasn’t confident to cycle on the busy streets." },
      { author: "Bradley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-18", text: "We loved the early morning bike tour while spending a couple of days in Jaipur, this was the best way to experience some of the cities gems while on a shorter stay. Led by Pranshu & Aman - these guys were knowledgeable, welcoming and provided us with a truly memorable experience. We even went on to book their evening walking tour with Pranshu which was equally as amazing and memorable too. All in all, a 10/10 from us… thank you!" },
      { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-10", text: "It was very fun experiencing Jaipur as a local. Henu and Yudi were awesome and helped us feel safe on the roads. They took lots of pictures for us and allowed us to try some local (safe) food. Would definitely recommend if you want to experience the real Jaipur!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/8047875/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Dimitri", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "We really enjoyed getting a view into life in Jaipur as the city wakes up. Starting at 6am may sound early but it was a pleasure moving around when the temperature was cool and cycleing down main roads without much traffic. Our guides, Jyoti and Sameer, were caring, knowledgeable, and engaged. It was also nice to do a tour that brought you into worlds that are otherwise inaccessible to outsiders eg laughing yoga and morning religious ceremony - without feeling like you are sticking out too much." },
      { author: "Grytsje", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-13", text: "Hanu and Sam were our guides. we started 6:00 sharp with our tour. It was great!! we did several tactivitied and learned a lot about how Jaipur wakes up. Hanu and Sam were terrific guides. g speaking Good english, they were polite and told a lot of stories. we really had fun together", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/6647306/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/6647307/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/6647308/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Jonathan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-15", text: "Great early morning cycle trip to see Jaipur waking up. Hanu the guide and Parth were excellent making sure we were always safe. Cycling itself on high quality mountain bikes was pretty easy, mostly on quiet streets with plenty of stops. Hanu really bought the city to life with his knowledge, enthusiasm and pride for the city. Nice food and drink stops were included. This was a unique tour, highly recommended and worth getting up early for." },
      { author: "Juliette", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-09", text: "We had a wonderful morning seeing Jaipur by bike. Would highly recommend this activity and the guide made it such fun. The flower market and laughing yoga was a highlight. Thanks for looking after us x", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/6157795/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/6157796/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/6157797/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Anna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-02", text: "An amazing activity - best yet! We were a little sceptical about riding a bike in the busy streets but we were taken down quiet routes and also there was a safety bike to shepherd us when needed. Pushp and Jhori made sure it was a really comfortable ride. Plenty of stops along the way. Just the right amount of information given and then we were free to ask questions if we wanted. This really is a first class experience and a great way to see Jaipur. The food stops were perfect and we were always given plenty of sanitizer to keep everything hygienic. If you’re visiting Jaipur - this is a MUST! Don’t be put off by the early start!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/6038205/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/6038206/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/6038207/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Shasha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-01", text: "It was an unfortable morning, my best momery in Jaipur. We did so many activities within 3 hours, feeding the cow, tasting masala chai / snacks / lassi at local shop, visiting local food/ flower market, experiencing chanting in a local temple, and joining a lauging yogo which was absoluting healing and energizing. The tour is very well designed and flawless excuted. Our guide Jyoti and Khushi are very friendly and thoughtful, they took great care of every one in the tour, making sure that we are safe, and entertained us well. Abosultly love their energy and passion! Would highly recommend this tour, you won't regret! It totally worth getting up so early!" },
      { author: "Holly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-31", text: "What a wonderful tour - a fantastic way to see Jaipur on two wheels. Aman and the team were great, providing lots of information and also answering all our questions along the way. Our particular favourites were the veg and flower markets and the visit to the temple - a wonderful insight into some of the day to day lives. We would recommend to anyone and everyone - very enjoyable." },
      { author: "Anja", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-15", text: "We had an awesome tour with guides Kushi, Jyoti and Yudhi. They brought us to amazing places, we met locals at the market and temple, joined a lesson of laughing yoga and had an excellent try of local drinks and food. Guides took us through the traffic supersafe all the time. Big recommendation to join this tour!!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/5490757/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Katie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-30", text: "Absolutely fantastic and well worth the 6am early start. We really felt we experienced Jaipur waking up. Seeing and experiencing the activities of the locals was so much more interesting for me that traipsing round palaces or the other Terry tourist attractions. Loved joining the Hare Krishna morning worship and the laughing yoga in the park was hilarious. Up there with my best ever tour and cannot recommend this enough.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/5338552/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/5338553/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-3-hour-morning-bike-tour-of-jaipur-old/5338554/1600.webp"] },
    ],
  },
