  'jaipur-amer-fort-rooftop-cooking-class-with-dinner': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 4,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Cécile", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-09", text: "It was a perfect night. A warm welcome. We met the two owners of the hotel. It started by a coffee and a snack served on the roof. One of the owner took us for a tour in the center af Amer.He gave us lots of explanations about the history of the city and the temples we saw. The cooking lesson on the roof was so great. The lady who gave us the lesson was very nice, smiling and all the explanation about the dish we made was very clear. We made chapati, palak paneer, kadhi and lapssi. Everything was so good ! Duration was perfect not too short, not too long. The owner even offered to drive us back to our hotel in Jaipur. We recommend a lot this expérience !", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-amer-fort-rooftop-cooking-class-with-dinner/5748925/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-amer-fort-rooftop-cooking-class-with-dinner/5748926/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-amer-fort-rooftop-cooking-class-with-dinner/5748927/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Luuk", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-26", text: "Great evening with a good view of the Amer Fort. Besides the extensive and great explanation about the food, the family that owns the hotel taught us about Indian culture. They went above and beyond and even brought us back to our hotel! Would recommend!" },
      { author: "Ruby", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-18", text: "We had a great cooking class!! The family is super nice and warm and welcoming, food is good and would recommend it :)" },
    ],
  },
  'jaipur-authentic-home-cooking-class-with-a-local-f': {
    averageRating: 4.94,
    totalReviews: 68,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.96,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Jonathan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-20", text: "Superb! Felt so welcome and the cooking was great fun…and delicious!! Highly recommend." },
      { author: "Enikő", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-26", text: "Our cooking class with Monty and Harshita was super interesting and a highlight of our time in Jaipur. They welcomed us into their home and showed us a little piece of their every days. Openly answered all our questions and shared their love and knowledge about spices, cooking techniques and meals. Very special experience!" },
      { author: "Giulia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-02", text: "Cooking with Monty and his family was a truly wonderful experience! They were such welcoming hosts, making the evening feel special. I learned so much about the balance of spices and the secrets to preparing an authentic Thali; understanding how to properly use Garam Masala was a total game-changer. The food was sensational—so flavorful that the leftovers tasted just as good the next day! It was a joy to cook alongside Monty, his wife, and their daughter. To top it off, our tuk-tuk driver was incredibly punctual and drove very safely, making the whole trip stress-free. I highly recommend this for anyone seeking delicious food, great techniques, and even better company!" },
      { author: "Angela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-21", text: "This was an excellent experience. We felt so welcome in Monty & Hashita’s home and they explained the dishes we made very well. The menu was good! A mixture of a dal dish, spiced potatoes and vegetable curry, plus bread and a saffron rice pudding. Would highly recommend doing this if you can. It’s an authentic home experience with good conversation.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-authentic-home-cooking-class-with-a-local-f/5887207/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-22", text: "This was an excellent and casual class that took you through the fundamentals. Harshita and Monty went above and beyond and knew a lot and answered all my curious questions. If staying in the old town I suggest getting a taxi arranged, i didn’t and I regretted it. The people were so great I attended also the next day the food market tour which I adored." },
      { author: "Rebecca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-15", text: "Harshita, Monty and their daughter Gina were wonderful hosts - all very friendly and welcoming into their home! It was as great to learn tips and tricks about local cooking styles and techniques, that I will definitely be trying out when I get back home! Huge thank you for welcoming me into your home and teaching me these wonderful recipes, a wonderful experience here in Jaipur 🙏🏼✨", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-authentic-home-cooking-class-with-a-local-f/5497035/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-authentic-home-cooking-class-with-a-local-f/5497036/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Rachel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-13", text: "Such a great cooking class with Monty, Harshita and Gina! The food turned out delicious and the conversation was great too! Fantastic class overall and highly recommend" },
      { author: "Jan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-02", text: "increible experience. We got hosted by Monty's lovely family, cooked with them and enjoyed an amazing dinner! Absolutely recommendable" },
      { author: "Karen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-19", text: "We really loved the cooking session. All very personal and intimin. All in all a very unique expirence", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-authentic-home-cooking-class-with-a-local-f/5240647/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-authentic-home-cooking-class-with-a-local-f/5240648/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Zita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-05", text: "It was incredible! We cooked very delicious local dishes, and I learned a lot about Indian cuisine. The family was very kind, and their little daughter Gina is adorable. It was a very authentic experience to spend dinner with a local family, so I highly recommend it." },
      { author: "Alexander", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-01", text: "Lucky enough to have spent Christmas cooking with the wonderful Monty, Harshita and Gina. They were so welcoming and were the highlight of the trip. Couldn’t recommend enough! Will be back on the next visit :) P.s. Gina will be a superstar!" },
      { author: "Sara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-12", text: "This is a truly fantastic experience. Monty and Harshita form a spectacular team. They are truly open minded, welcoming and warm. You cannot be disappointed by this couple! You will have fun cooking with them..you will learn from Monty's professional and scientific cuisine and then, separately, from Harshita local grandma style knowledge built over the years living in the pink city. You will see how their styles are different and still complementary. Besides they really explain a lot of details about the different spices and local Indian cooking tricks. The real super star though is Gina their daughter. She's an absolut stunner, excellent dancer and performer. We cannot tell how sweet she is!! If you don't do this experience while in jaipur will will have lost a huge opportunity to meet three wonderful humans." },
    ],
  },
