  'jaipur-home-cooking-experience-with-authentic-lunc': {
    averageRating: 4.95,
    totalReviews: 14,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.67,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Leonie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-18", text: "We had a great time with the family and learned much about food but also about the indian culture. It was really interesting and the son and the mom were super nice and welcoming. A must visit place in Jaipur for sure!" },
      { author: "Peyton", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-02", text: "We had a wonderful experience at the cooking class. The family are very welcoming and accommodating. We got to watch and interact with multiple dishes being prepared and learn about different ingredients and how they are sourced. We learned a lot about the culture and the city of Jaipur. Would really recommend for anyone looking for an authentic experience with a local family" },
      { author: "emily", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-06", text: "really good experience, taught loads of interesting information for cooking indian food and the meal was delicious, I was happy with the level of interaction and the comfort of being welcomed into someone's home" },
      { author: "Emily", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-26", text: "We had a lovely experience cooking with this family! We were welcomed into their home with the best masala chai we’ve had in India. Afterward the ladies explained the ingredients as we helped chop vegetables. They showed us their techniques and we got to make our own chapatis! This was a great way to spend a few hours with a local family and share an authentic meal!" },
      { author: "Bertoli", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-03", text: "Great experience, nice people, wonderful training and dinner!!! We recommend all foreign people to try it!! Cesarina from Italy and Michel from France" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "インドで本格的な家庭料理を体験できる、とても楽しい料理教室でした！ まずはチャイでおもてなししていただき、その後、4種類ほどのカレーの作り方を教えてもらいました。今回はチキンカレー、オクラカレー、じゃがいもカレー、豆カレーを作り、さらにチャパティの作り方も体験しました。 料理を作った後は、みんなで一緒に完成した料理をいただきます。どの料理も本当に美味しく、スパイスの使い方なども学べて、とても良い経験になりました。 中でも一番気に入ったのは、じゃがいもカレー。シンプルな料理なのに驚くほど美味しくて、個人的には今回食べた中で一番好きでした！ インドの家庭料理を実際に作って、最後にみんなで食べられるので、インドの食文化を体験したい人にはかなりおすすめです。", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-home-cooking-experience-with-authentic-lunc/8548086/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-home-cooking-experience-with-authentic-lunc/8548088/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-home-cooking-experience-with-authentic-lunc/8548089/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-13", text: "Jättekul och gott!" },
      { author: "Marine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-17", text: "Nous avons passé un très bon moment aux côtés de cette très gentille famille ! Nous avons cuisiné \"mixed vegetables\", un dahl et un chicken green korma. En plus d'avoir appris de nouvelles recettes, nous nous sommes régalés avec nos propres plats ! C'était vraiment succulent ! Un véritable moment de partage comme on les aime ! Recommandé à 500%" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-22", text: "The food was really good - and so was the chat. We really enjoyed seeing so many delicious veg dishes being made. We learned a lot!!" },
      { author: "Nathalie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-24", text: "une activité authentique, nous avons été super bien reçus par la famille et le cours était complet. plus qu à reproduire ce mélange de épices! Nous avons passé un excellent moment.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-home-cooking-experience-with-authentic-lunc/3942106/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-home-cooking-experience-with-authentic-lunc/3942108/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-10-20", text: "Shoaib made be feel part of his family while his mother showed me how to make their favourite everyday local dishes" },
      { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2023-10-18", text: "The guide and his family were lovely, and getting to spend the time and have a meal in his house was great. But this is advertised as a cooking class, where as I felt like I just watched people cook and stirred a pot twice. The food was really good, but like I said above. This is more a local lunch experience than a cooking class. For a local experience and understanding of how they cook their dishes, this would be perfect. But if you’re looking for a hands on, learning experience, unfortunately this is not the one." },
    ],
  },
