  'jaipur-private-full-day-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tu': {
    averageRating: 4.93,
    totalReviews: 22,
    guideRating: 4.91,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "rebecca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-22", text: "I am having a great experience - my guide Khalid is tailoring the tour to my interests and showed me a beautiful place not on the list but so far my favourite - Royal Ghetto - which I recommend. I was clear I didn’t want to visit “rug store” or other shopping and he respected that. He even gave me great tips to avoid pressure sales at historical sites which gave me a much better experience. Thank you Khalid", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-full-day-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tu/6331553/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-private-full-day-sightseeing-tour-by-tuk-tu/6331554/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Tom", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-18", text: "An incredible day from start to finish. Hani was fantastic — thank you for such a memorable experience! ☺️" },
      { author: "Daniel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-15", text: "Vinod was a stand out guide and extraordinarily flexible with everything we wanted to do, try and see. He picked us up earlier than our booking time at our request. He changed various stops at our request and added in some great local spots of his own. He was an excellent driver, host, and guide. His English is also great. Itinerary: the stops and recommendations were great and it was very efficient. It was nice to always have a friendly ride available and get insider information on each spot and what to see and not see. Local spots: We stopped at local street food areas for great kachori, samosas, lassi, fruits and more as my wife and I wanted to experience local street food and spices. We also had some amazing gajjak (sweets) at a local stand where it was made in front of us which was incredible and the best Laal Maas! Finally, Vinod runs a family business with 6 brothers also doing tours across India. I highly recommend contacting Vinod for really any potential travel!" },
      { author: "Sushant", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-01", text: "Mr. Adil, our guide and driver, was absolutely exceptional throughout the entire trip. His warm, friendly attitude made us feel comfortable from the very beginning, and he went above and beyond to ensure we had the best possible experience. He explained everything clearly, offered helpful suggestions, and guided us with genuine care and professionalism." },
      { author: "Jiss", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-15", text: "The guide Mr. Raghuveer Singh and cab driver Suresh was really friendly and gave us a really good experience taking us to all the places and giving us a brief about everything. Overall a great experience at Jaipur." },
      { author: "Julius", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-08", text: "It was really great! Mr. Ali the guide&driver arrived on time and took me to the highlights of the tour. He was friendly and patient to all my questions and he drives safely. He even helped me with my simcard needs! Hope you get this tour too." },
      { author: "Kamal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-05", text: "Exploring Jaipur by tuk-tuk with Mr. Mohsin was an incredible experience. He guided me throughout the journey, accommodating changes to the itinerary seamlessly. His professionalism and extensive knowledge of Jaipur made the trip truly enjoyable. I highly recommend Mr. Mohsin, his wonderful tuk-tuk, and this tour company." },
      { author: "Ashish", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-20", text: "The tuk tuk was classic and very well maintained. The driver was very calm, helpful and supportive." },
      { author: "Sayan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-03", text: "Had a wonderful time. Mr. Sharif is a great guy - went out of his way to help us out." },
      { author: "HELENE", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-13", text: "It was a real pleasure to discover Jaipur with our tuktuk driver! he listened and took our wishes into account and showed us excellent addresses! he was adorable to our children. thanks to him, we had an excellent stay in Jaipur" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-07", text: "Our Tuk Tuk driver was very nice and knowledgeable about Jaipur. He guide us through the all city showing his expertise, experience and kindness. I fully recommend you this driver, the best in the city!!" },
      { author: "Jacqueline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-27", text: "We had a wonderful day with Vinod. Communication prior to the tour was fantastic and we were met in time and presented with flower garlands. Vinod was knowledgable and explained about the different places we visited and also told us about the local culture. He had a great sense of humour and shared lots of ideas and top tips for our visit to India. He was very flexible and we were able to change the itinerary so we could see a different place on our list. We loved visiting the Amber Palace and City Palace. Lunch was in a lovely place and not over priced. I would highly recommend booking this tour." },
    ],
  },
