  'jaipur-shopping-tour-with-blue-poetry-printing-wor': {
    averageRating: 4.93,
    totalReviews: 49,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 4.97,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Rahul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "From beginning to end, this was an absolutely fantastic experience. Shakeer truly went above and beyond and made Jaipur one of the highlights of our trip through India. He tailored the tour entirely to what we wanted to see and buy, including carpets, clothing, fabrics, spices, pottery and jewellery, while also being incredibly flexible with spontaneous requests, such as camel riding. When we spotted camels and asked if we could stop, he immediately adjusted the programme! He also took us to great local shops and even negotiated with shopkeepers to make sure we paid fair prices. His hospitality was exceptional. He even gave us saffron and traditional clay cups as keepsakes. Of all the guides we had in India, Shakeer was by far the best: kind, knowledgeable, trustworthy and genuinely passionate about giving you an unforgettable experience. If you visit Jaipur or India’s Golden Triangle, we 100% recommend Shakeer. 10/10!" },
      { author: "Riya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "Shakeer was incredibly nice and took great care of us. He made us feel welcomed and took us to great spots." },
      { author: "Sophia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "The activity was amazing. We got to see so many different sides of Jaipur. Our guide was so nice and helpful through the whole experience. He made us feel really comfortable and showed us around everywhere. Overall best experience!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-shopping-tour-with-blue-poetry-printing-wor/8570771/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-shopping-tour-with-blue-poetry-printing-wor/8570772/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/jaipur-shopping-tour-with-blue-poetry-printing-wor/8570773/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Sienna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-02", text: "My guide shakeer was fantastic. I highly recommend booking this tour with him, he is kind, knowledgeable and has your best interests at heart. And as a solo traveller he was a great source of advice! If you are looking for the best time in Jaipur, look no further and book this tour immediately!" },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-28", text: "Wewere picked up in neat and clean car by Maliq, he was really friendly helpful and told us a lot about each and every place we went to, and everything we crossed on the way. he took us to a place where we experienced hand block printing and later shopped, unique pieces of clothes, bedsheets, blankets, and more. After that, we were taken to experience Blue pottery from the scratch which has the GI tag of India, and we saw artisans paint in front of us, and later bought some blue pottery pieces. after that on special request, Malik took us to Maharani Bazar for some more shopping. finally, we ended the tour with some local snacks, which was also recommended by Malik. each and every single place we were taken to was nice, clean, hygienic, and the staff of each and every single place was very polite and welcoming and new proper English. So there was no communication gap or barrier throughout the tour. Malik also has knowledge about Jaipur and all over India, all tourist places." },
      { author: "Claire", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-04", text: "I had a great day shopping with Shakeer, he checked in beforehand and I shared the ideas of what I was interested in and when we met was well prepared with ideas and options. We stopped at the Blue Pottery which was great to see how this was created and try the potters wheel. We then went to an amazing block printing place where I arranged for some skirts and tops to be made and delivered to my hotel. Found a new suitcase to add all my new purchases into and then stopped for some souvenirs! The trip was tailored exactly to my needs. Also as a solo female traveller I felt well looked after and very safe. Highly recommend" },
      { author: "Aniket", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-07", text: "We went around with Shakeer. He nicely took us to local workshops where we could see the artisans working. We could even participate for a few of those. We ended up shopping a lot. Overall it was worth it!" },
      { author: "Christeena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-22", text: "We had a great experience, our guide was very kind and helpful. Also the places he took us to were really amazing! We shopped a lot!" },
      { author: "Celina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-18", text: "It was so enjoyable to not only learn about the processes of pottery, block printing but also to have an opportunity to try it ourselves. Very informative, intimate and fun :)" },
      { author: "kirk", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-18", text: "We had a great time in this tour. The guide was able to tailor the tour to your requests allowing us to spend time doing exactly what we wanted and seeing the shops we wanted. For us that meant doing a spur of the moment pottery class. He took us to great whole sale places offering better prices than other shops we’ve seen. I can’t believe how beautiful and cheap the pottery we bought was!!" },
      { author: "Hirva", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-17", text: "Great spots, our best part was the blue pottery workshop. Such hardworking people, and amazing art! Thanks for a great experience, Shakir bhai and Ali bhai!" },
      { author: "Mythili", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-13", text: "As family we were on trip to Jaipur for the first time. we were taken care by Nadeem khan ji. from pick up to whole day. he had taken care of us well and guided us to places with friendliness and humbleness." },
    ],
  },
