  'old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with': {
    averageRating: 4.8,
    totalReviews: 8,
    guideRating: 4.8,
    valueRating: 4.8,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Keisha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-15", text: "WOW! This was an incredible tour! As a solo female traveller, zubairs energy and warmth was so comforting and welcoming. The street foods were not only all closely vetted for no dehli belly but all so delicious taking into account all dietary needs. Our riksha Islam was incredible and attentive to the busy corridors of old dehli and my driver Rahim was an expert driver on the busy dehli roads. I cannot reccomend this tour enough.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with/4913678/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with/4913679/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with/4913680/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Charlotte", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-04-27", text: "Nice to explore the market at night and to experience the buzzing atmosphere. We went to the spice market and tried plenty of street food. Be sure to come on an empty stomach!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with/6418294/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with/6418295/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with/6418296/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-19", text: "Zunair is very helpful. We tried many different food, and he also helped solved my other problems. Super considerate!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with/8809533/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with/8809534/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with/8809535/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Konrad", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-27", text: "Mein Guide Karan Singh und der Fahrer Ali haben mich pünktlich abgeholt. Es war eine wunderbare Tour, erst mit dem Auto, dann mit der Rikscha durch die engen Gassen. Sehr authentischer Eindruck in das Leben der Einheimischen. Tolle Food-Spots. Mit viel Vertrauen in meinen Guide habe ich alles probiert, was er empfohlen hat. Meinem Magen geht’s auch Stunden später noch sehr gut. Dazu wusste Karan viel über die Geschichte des Landes und die verschiedenen Religionen zu berichten. Der Verkehr auf den Straßen war wild, nochmal verrückter als am Tag. Aber ich habe mich die ganze Zeit sicher gefühlt. Eine tolle Tour und sehr zu empfehlendener Guide, der gut Deutsch spricht!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with/5968942/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with/5968943/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with/5968944/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "GetYourGuide traveler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-02-22", text: "It was a lovely seeing Ild Delhi changing from day to night. Rickshaw was fab to get around and experience more of the unique Delhi driving! My guide Naved was great showing me a glimpse of this busy place and some good local food places, that the locals use.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/old-delhi-food-tour-a-night-time-feast-with/5575716/1600.webp"] },
    ],
  },
