  'taj-mahal-delhi-full-day-tour': {
    averageRating: 4.9,
    totalReviews: 3800,
    guideRating: 4.93,
    valueRating: 4.88,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Christos", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-26", text: "We had a fantastic experience exploring Agra with Najam. His impressive knowledge brought the stories and history of the Taj Mahal, Agra Fort and Baby Taj to life. He shared interesting details at every stop and answered all our questions clearly. Najam was warm, courteous and attentive throughout the tour, making us feel comfortable and welcome. His wonderful personality and enthusiasm made our day truly special. An outstanding guide whom we would happily recommend!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-delhi-full-day-tour/8924549/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-delhi-full-day-tour/8924550/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-delhi-full-day-tour/8924552/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Đoàn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-24", text: "MK was super helpful and attentive. If I could give him 10 stars, I would give him 11" },
      { author: "Hélène", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-23", text: "Farman was a wonderful guide! He took us to the Taj Mahal, Baby Taj Mahal, Agra Fort and more, and brought each place to life by sharing the stories and history behind them. It made the whole experience so much more interesting and memorable! The driver was also very accommodating and conveniently arranged a pickup from our hotel, even though it was outside their usual pickup zone. We had an amazing experience and would definitely recommend Farman! (He also took a LOT of good photos!!!)" },
      { author: "Aline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-23", text: "Aayush was the best guide, showing me the secrets and curiosity of Taj Mahal. Would repeat this trip, no regret. I love it", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-delhi-full-day-tour/8869654/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Alexandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-21", text: "We had a wonderful tour of Agra, visiting the Taj Mahal and Agra Fort, and the whole experience was absolutely amazing. A special thank you to our guide, Pravendra, who was incredibly attentive, knowledgeable, and friendly. He told us so many interesting stories and details about the history, architecture, and culture behind the places we visited, which made the experience much more meaningful and enjoyable. We really appreciated how patiently he answered all our questions and made sure we had a great time. We also want to thank our driver, Javed, who was very professional, kind, and careful throughout the day. We always felt safe and comfortable with him. He treated me like a princess and opened the door every time I got out of the car. 🥹 Overall, it was a wonderful and very interesting experience, and having Pravendra and Javed with us made the day even more special. We would definitely recommend this tour to anyone visiting Agra!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-delhi-full-day-tour/8839154/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-delhi-full-day-tour/8839157/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Brit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-19", text: "We had a wonderful day with Nagam and our driver Kailash. Nagam was very knowledgable and extremely kind. He took amazing pictures and explained enough history to inform us but not to bore us in the heat. Thank you." },
      { author: "Sai", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Booking this tour was the best decision we made for our trip to Agra, and our guide MK was absolutely phenomenal. He is incredibly knowledgeable about the history, architecture, and hidden details of the Taj Mahal that you would never notice on your own. He knew exactly how to navigate the crowds and where to stand for the absolute best photos. MK was patient, friendly, and truly passionate about sharing the beauty of this monument. If you are booking this tour, make sure you ask for him. 10/10 highly recommend" },
      { author: "John", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "Kash was very knowledgeable and friendly Personable and very calm and patient He is an excellent guide and speaks great English and also French! Hope you get him! Nothing was too much trouble" },
      { author: "Betsy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Aayush was my guide in Agra. He was very informative and we had a great day. As a single female traveler I felt safe and really enjoyed my time. My driver Dev was also great. He was on time and met me at my hotel in Dehli." },
      { author: "Bryan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Amazing activity! You get to learn a lot about all the history in Agra! Aamir is an excelent guide, besides he speaks very good Spanish and English! Also good transport from Delhi! The guide gives you enough time to discover and tells you a lot about every place! Absolutely recommended!" },
      { author: "LaTee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "My guide's name was Farhan. The driver was courteous, picking me up on time and safely getting me to Agra. Farhan was incredibly detailed. He picked up on my love of architecture and gave me so much history on the site. There's a government-authorized photographer on site who gives great poses. I'll be honest, the pictures Farhan took were mind-blowing, but I'd still suggest booking one of the photo packages, but go on a clear day for the best shots. Farhan speaks four languages English, Hindi, French, and Urdu and knows that ends and out of the tour. He took us to a restaurant called Taj Mahal for breakfast, the omelette was surprisingly amazing, even coming from Chicago cheese expectations. We also visited an art place with beautiful jewelry work, but my favorite stop was the mosaic workshop, where you see the ancient craftsmanship that built the Taj Mahal. That art is dying out, and what they can still do is incredible , I'd really encourage supporting them. Overall, amazing!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-delhi-full-day-tour/8631503/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-delhi-full-day-tour/8631504/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/taj-mahal-delhi-full-day-tour/8631505/1600.webp"] },
      { author: "Alejandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "It was amazing! The tour guide was amazing. As a female solo travel I feel very safe with him! It is completely worth it🤍" },
    ],
  },
